WEBVTT


00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:47.200
Go ahead.

00:01:48.879 --> 00:01:49.840
Head back early and get some rest.

00:01:49.959 --> 00:01:50.319
Okay.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:56.319
Bye.

00:02:55.919 --> 00:02:56.439
Who's there?

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.479
Where are your manners? Who are you people?

00:03:00.599 --> 00:03:01.240
Xu Duoduo.

00:03:03.879 --> 00:03:04.560
Keep watch outside.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:17.680
Captain Lu, this is Li Xiao.

00:03:18.039 --> 00:03:19.719
I've spotted the suspect, Li Qiang.

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:22.199
At 39 Hubin Road, Building 16, Room 409.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:23.039
Stay put and keep watch.

00:03:23.439 --> 00:03:24.520
Whatever you do, do not spook the target.

00:03:24.639 --> 00:03:25.120
Copy that.

00:03:31.159 --> 00:03:31.800
Captain Bai.

00:03:32.039 --> 00:03:33.439
Suspect Li Qiang has been located.

00:03:33.919 --> 00:03:35.719
Yuelan Bay Community, 39 Hubin Road.

00:03:35.719 --> 00:03:37.840
Good. I'll have the tactical unit set up surveillance immediately.

00:03:38.879 --> 00:03:39.599
Don't hit me!

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:41.400
Please, don't hit me!

00:03:41.639 --> 00:03:43.520
Moving product on my turf?

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:46.319
You've got some nerve.

00:03:47.159 --> 00:03:47.560
Boss...

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:49.080
I didn't know!

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.360
I had no idea that was your turf.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:51.960
I used to run with Brother Liang.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.039
He had my back.

00:03:53.319 --> 00:03:54.400
Then Brother Liang went down,

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:56.439
and I had nowhere to get supply.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:58.879
A lot of my clients had already paid deposits.

00:03:59.199 --> 00:04:00.280
If I didn't deliver the goods,

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:01.759
they would've killed me!

00:04:02.159 --> 00:04:03.240
Then someone called...

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:05.759
named... named Four-Legged Snake contacted me.

00:04:06.599 --> 00:04:07.599
He said he had supply,

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:09.879
and that lots of places were pushing his stuff.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:10.919
What Four-Legged Snake?

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.680
I think you're Four-Legged Snake!

00:04:12.879 --> 00:04:13.639
No, boss!

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:16.360
I really didn't know that was your turf.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.000
From now on...

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.079
I'll quit the business for good, alright?

00:04:21.319 --> 00:04:23.639
You think you can just get on this ship

00:04:24.319 --> 00:04:25.519
and get off whenever you want?

00:04:26.439 --> 00:04:27.639
Listen to me very carefully.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.040
My name is Li Qiang.

00:04:30.319 --> 00:04:31.759
Spread the word for me.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.759
From now on, everyone in the circle

00:04:34.279 --> 00:04:36.279
only gets supply through me.

00:04:36.399 --> 00:04:37.319
You understand?

00:04:37.759 --> 00:04:38.319
Understood.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:40.000
No matter who wants supply,

00:04:40.319 --> 00:04:41.399
they must go through Brother Qiang.

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:45.199
Those venues at Blue Caribbean...

00:04:45.879 --> 00:04:46.839
they're yours to run.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.319
I told you I'm not drunk.

00:05:06.519 --> 00:05:07.680
He kept forcing drinks on me.

00:05:08.279 --> 00:05:09.000
Go to sleep.

00:05:11.879 --> 00:05:12.360
Here's the situation.

00:05:12.759 --> 00:05:14.319
Your neighbor might be a drug dealer.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:15.480
Don't be scared.

00:05:15.839 --> 00:05:17.240
My colleagues are on their way.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:19.279
Go inside first. I'm right here.

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.120
Don't worry. Go on.

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:23.839
This Four-Legged Snake you mentioned...

00:06:24.639 --> 00:06:26.079
what's his real name?

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:27.720
I have no idea.

00:06:28.959 --> 00:06:29.879
I've never even seen him.

00:06:30.319 --> 00:06:31.399
All I know is

00:06:31.879 --> 00:06:33.639
a lot of people get their stuff from him.

00:06:34.399 --> 00:06:35.079
Then do you know

00:06:35.199 --> 00:06:37.279
which spots he frequents?

00:06:39.879 --> 00:06:40.920
I heard

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.160
he hits all the clubs Brother Liang used to cover.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:46.800
And he always brings three or four guys along.

00:06:46.879 --> 00:06:47.800
Quite a big shot, huh?

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.360
Yeah, he's a big deal.

00:06:50.199 --> 00:06:52.319
Do you know who his supplier is?

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:57.000
I heard his guys mention

00:06:57.439 --> 00:06:59.680
someone called Chameleon.

00:06:59.879 --> 00:07:01.360
But I don't know who that really is.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.160
Still, he said their stuff

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:07.000
comes straight from the Golden Triangle.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:19.680
You trying to scare me?

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.600
Isn't Four-Legged Snake just Chameleon?

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:25.680
No, no, no, I wouldn't dare!

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:26.560
I'd never dare scare you, boss.

00:07:26.959 --> 00:07:28.040
I just took what I heard

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.480
and told you directly.

00:07:29.839 --> 00:07:31.199
With how little I know,

00:07:31.319 --> 00:07:34.240
how was I to know Chameleon is Four-Legged Snake?

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:40.120
Captain Lu.

00:07:40.879 --> 00:07:41.800
Mobile Unit, report your position.

00:07:42.199 --> 00:07:43.680
2.7 kilometers from the destination.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:44.720
Get there as fast as you can.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:45.439
Copy that.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:18.079
Faster! Hurry up!

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:18.639
Yes, sir!

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:34.440
All units, be advised.

00:08:34.759 --> 00:08:35.679
The suspect is about to appear.

00:08:35.759 --> 00:08:36.759
Stand by to make the arrest.

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:38.360
Copy that.

00:08:47.919 --> 00:08:48.919
Do you have a phone?

00:08:49.519 --> 00:08:50.080
Yeah.

00:08:51.559 --> 00:08:52.039
Yeah.

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:53.039
There's a landline in my room,

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:54.080
and I've got two cell phones.

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:58.799
I'm asking if you have Chameleon's number!

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:00.799
No, I don't.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:02.960
I never contact him.

00:09:03.559 --> 00:09:04.559
He always calls me.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:05.919
And he uses a different number every time.

00:09:46.279 --> 00:09:48.000
Boss, we found a new lead.

00:09:48.399 --> 00:09:49.080
Li Qiang's next move

00:09:49.159 --> 00:09:50.559
is bringing a large shipment of drugs into Nanhai.

00:09:50.919 --> 00:09:52.840
It will also involve another drug ring.

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.159
I recommend calling off the arrest

00:09:54.559 --> 00:09:55.279
and continuing surveillance.

00:09:55.559 --> 00:09:56.360
All right, copy that.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.840
Did you remember everything I told you today?

00:09:59.919 --> 00:10:00.600
I got it.

00:10:01.399 --> 00:10:02.399
Just listen to Brother Qiang from now on.

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.919
I'll come see you every two weeks from now on.

00:10:06.879 --> 00:10:08.240
Next time, I'll bring you some stuff.

00:10:11.279 --> 00:10:12.120
Here.

00:10:13.519 --> 00:10:15.120
This is the latest sample.

00:10:17.159 --> 00:10:18.759
Its purity is even higher

00:10:19.559 --> 00:10:20.480
than Wu Liang's supply.

00:10:22.559 --> 00:10:25.120
And stop wasting time on small-time buyers.

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.080
To make quick cash, find more big clients.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.519
Understood, Brother Qiang.

00:10:34.159 --> 00:10:35.240
Take care, Brother Qiang. See you, Brother Qiang.

00:10:43.279 --> 00:10:44.399
All units, attention. All units, attention.

00:10:44.759 --> 00:10:45.799
Abort the arrest immediately.

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:46.720
Stand by in position.

00:10:47.039 --> 00:10:48.039
Do not spook the target!

00:10:48.679 --> 00:10:49.279
Copy that.

00:10:53.759 --> 00:10:54.679
Calling off the arrest again?

00:10:57.279 --> 00:10:58.639
Li Qiang has no criminal record.

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:01.240
Plus, he isn't carrying any drugs on him this time.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.240
If we can't catch him red-handed,

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:04.360
we'll just have to release him anyway.

00:11:05.919 --> 00:11:06.720
I understand.

00:11:26.399 --> 00:11:27.000
Brother Qiang,

00:11:27.519 --> 00:11:28.519
this Four-Legged Snake

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:30.440
can't really be called a Chameleon.

00:11:31.159 --> 00:11:31.799
What do you mean?

00:11:32.360 --> 00:11:34.080
A four-legged snake is just a lizard.

00:11:34.559 --> 00:11:36.639
Most lizards can change color,

00:11:36.679 --> 00:11:38.720
but only the best of them

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.240
can truly be called chameleons.

00:11:41.919 --> 00:11:43.159
Who said that?

00:11:43.799 --> 00:11:44.960
They said so on *Animal World*!

00:11:46.279 --> 00:11:48.639
Looks to me like you crawled right out of *Animal World*.

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:50.080
Let's go. Move out.

00:11:56.039 --> 00:11:58.759
Guan Qiang, take the mobile unit and tail them.

00:11:59.159 --> 00:11:59.840
Don't blow your cover.

00:12:00.679 --> 00:12:01.120
Copy that.

00:12:09.039 --> 00:12:10.840
Li Qiang is back in Nanhai now.

00:12:11.279 --> 00:12:11.799
I think

00:12:12.159 --> 00:12:14.159
we'll be watching quite a show soon.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:16.399
Captain Bai, what brings you here?

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:18.679
There's a new lead in the case.

00:12:19.559 --> 00:12:20.279
I had to come.

00:12:20.399 --> 00:12:21.039
Have a seat.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:23.840
What's the situation?

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:25.879
The mobile unit is tailing the suspect,

00:12:26.519 --> 00:12:28.519
hoping to locate their hideout.

00:12:28.879 --> 00:12:30.399
Criminal Investigation sent extra officers

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:33.120
to stake out near Xu Duoduo's place.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.559
If we want to gather more intel,

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.080
we'll have to set up surveillance

00:12:38.159 --> 00:12:39.639
in Room 410, right next door.

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:43.039
Have you contacted the tenant of Room 410?

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.320
Li Xiao is speaking with her in the conference room.

00:12:49.799 --> 00:12:51.039
Wiretapping from my place?

00:12:52.759 --> 00:12:54.559
Then what... what about me?

00:12:54.639 --> 00:12:57.639
You can just carry on as usual.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:12:59.639
How can I carry on as usual?

00:12:59.759 --> 00:13:02.080
You're bugging the suspect next door from my apartment.

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:02.960
Doesn't that mean everything I do

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:05.120
will be watched right under your noses?

00:13:05.399 --> 00:13:06.759
And by more than just a couple of people!

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:08.919
Good point.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.919
Why don't you stay over at my place for now?

00:13:13.879 --> 00:13:15.279
I... that's not what I meant.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:15.799
I...

00:13:17.559 --> 00:13:18.120
Captain Bai.

00:13:19.399 --> 00:13:21.080
Captain Bai, this is the neighbor

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:24.320
of the suspect under investigation.

00:13:24.919 --> 00:13:25.799
This is our Captain Bai.

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:27.399
Hello.

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:28.960
Hello, Captain.

00:13:29.159 --> 00:13:29.639
Please, have a seat.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:37.639
May I ask your name?

00:13:37.679 --> 00:13:39.600
Tian Xin, 24 years old.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.080
Owner of Maple Leaf Cafe.

00:13:41.279 --> 00:13:43.080
I currently live alone in Room 410.

00:13:50.879 --> 00:13:53.600
Are you familiar with the suspect living across from you?

00:13:53.799 --> 00:13:55.480
I only moved into this building six months ago,

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:58.240
so I don't really know the neighbors.

00:13:58.720 --> 00:14:00.320
But as for this Xu Duoduo guy,

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.679
I do know a little bit about him.

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:02.799
When I moved in,

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:03.840
he helped me carry my stuff

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:05.840
and introduced himself.

00:14:06.639 --> 00:14:09.639
He never mentioned dealing drugs, though.

00:14:11.159 --> 00:14:12.720
What did he say he did?

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.840
He said he was a DJ,

00:14:15.279 --> 00:14:17.240
and claimed to know lots of people in showbiz.

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:19.080
His workplace was called

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.559
Black Panther Club.

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:22.480
He even gave me a VIP card,

00:14:23.919 --> 00:14:25.279
but I've never gone there.

00:14:30.519 --> 00:14:30.960
So,

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:32.639
you two did interact quite a bit?

00:14:35.399 --> 00:14:36.399
Not really.

00:14:36.879 --> 00:14:38.919
He's just kind of weird, you know?

00:14:39.279 --> 00:14:40.120
Flattering himself.

00:14:40.279 --> 00:14:42.919
He was always buying me late-night snacks.

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.679
Still, to me,

00:14:47.399 --> 00:14:48.679
he didn't seem like a bad guy.

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:50.559
Does a criminal go around

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:52.000
with "criminal" written on their face?

00:14:52.159 --> 00:14:53.360
How could you be so careless?

00:14:54.039 --> 00:14:54.639
Li Xiao!

00:14:55.519 --> 00:14:56.360
What kind of attitude is that?

00:14:56.519 --> 00:14:57.919
Well, don't you always

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.159
tell us to teach our citizens

00:15:00.279 --> 00:15:01.360
how to protect themselves?

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:04.240
Right?

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:15.440
Thank you, Tian Xin.

00:15:15.919 --> 00:15:18.279
The information you provided has been a huge help.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:19.120
Please wait here for a moment.

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:20.240
Later on,

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:21.720
we'll have a car drive you back.

00:15:21.879 --> 00:15:22.679
Okay, thank you.

00:15:25.879 --> 00:15:26.759
Come inside with me.

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:35.759
He even brought you late-night snacks.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.159
It's not like I accepted them.

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:38.279
You're jealous.

00:15:38.759 --> 00:15:39.159
Li Xiao.

00:15:58.759 --> 00:15:59.240
Brother Qiang.

00:15:59.799 --> 00:16:00.639
That black car behind us...

00:16:00.799 --> 00:16:02.000
has been tailing us for two blocks.

00:16:10.559 --> 00:16:13.600
Could the cops be onto us the second we got back to Nanhai?

00:16:15.919 --> 00:16:16.840
Head for the outskirts.

00:16:30.039 --> 00:16:32.320
Captain Lu, the suspect's vehicle is heading towards the suburbs.

00:16:32.519 --> 00:16:33.440
Should we keep tailing him?

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:34.799
Stop following him.

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.159
Don't spook the target.

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:36.679
Copy that.

00:16:40.159 --> 00:16:40.639
What happened?

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:42.799
Li Qiang just drove towards the suburbs.

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:44.559
I suspect he might've noticed something.

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:46.159
So I told Guan Qiang to back off.

00:16:46.759 --> 00:16:47.600
Which means...

00:16:47.799 --> 00:16:48.720
Xu Duoduo has now become

00:16:48.799 --> 00:16:50.799
our only lead on Li Qiang's movements.

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:55.159
Xu Duoduo and Tian Xin must be connected.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.759
But if we do as discussed earlier

00:16:57.799 --> 00:16:59.440
and send in a large team of officers,

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:00.360
first,

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:01.879
it's very likely to blow our cover.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:03.960
Second, it might put Tian Xin in danger.

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:07.440
Then have Tian Xin move out,

00:17:07.799 --> 00:17:08.880
and we'll move in to set up wiretaps.

00:17:09.279 --> 00:17:10.400
I talked to her already.

00:17:10.599 --> 00:17:11.559
She refused.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.240
Then you weren't firm enough.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.759
As they say, the police and the public are one family.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:20.720
Since a large police presence won't work,

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:22.119
let's just send one officer in.

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.000
Move into her home,

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:26.519
pose as her relative,

00:17:26.599 --> 00:17:27.480
or a friend.

00:17:28.279 --> 00:17:30.400
First, we can monitor Xu Duoduo's movements.

00:17:30.559 --> 00:17:32.680
Second, we can ensure Ms. Tian's safety.

00:17:33.079 --> 00:17:33.839
Don't worry, Captain Lu.

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:35.160
I'll definitely convince her this time.

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:37.799
Sounds good to me.

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:39.599
Let Zhuang Yan go.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:42.720
Wait, what?

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:43.519
Captain Bai, I think

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:45.200
I'm fully qualified for this mission.

00:17:45.519 --> 00:17:46.559
Why can't Zhuang Yan go?

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:47.799
No, he...

00:17:48.559 --> 00:17:49.839
He definitely won't do.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.240
He's way too impulsive.

00:17:51.519 --> 00:17:52.319
To pull off this mission,

00:17:52.359 --> 00:17:53.480
you need someone steady,

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:54.960
sensible, and quiet.

00:17:55.279 --> 00:17:55.680
Right?

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:56.839
I think I'm up for it.

00:17:57.079 --> 00:17:58.279
I think he can do it, too.

00:17:59.079 --> 00:18:00.599
I also think Zhuang Yan is a great fit.

00:18:00.759 --> 00:18:01.480
See?

00:18:05.839 --> 00:18:07.400
Who's paying for supper tonight?

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:10.039
It's on me! I've got it!

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:11.920
Now you're the perfect fit.

00:18:13.839 --> 00:18:15.440
Since someone stepped up,

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:16.359
"someone"

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:19.200
will be assigned to this mission.

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:21.400
Consider it done, Captain Bai!

00:18:22.839 --> 00:18:23.759
Listen up, everyone.

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:26.359
The Black Panther Club is very likely to become,

00:18:26.359 --> 00:18:27.599
after the Xiangdu Entertainment Club,

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:29.559
the next biggest drug trafficking venue.

00:18:30.279 --> 00:18:32.119
So we must uncover as soon as possible

00:18:32.319 --> 00:18:34.559
all relevant information regarding those involved.

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:35.279
However,

00:18:35.759 --> 00:18:37.359
until we have concrete evidence,

00:18:37.559 --> 00:18:39.640
do not act recklessly and spook the target.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:40.680
The moment you get any intel,

00:18:40.759 --> 00:18:41.559
report it immediately.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:42.279
Yes, sir! Yes, sir!

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:43.839
There's one more matter

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:44.839
to announce to everyone.

00:18:46.279 --> 00:18:47.839
Director Huang transferred a newcomer to our squad.

00:18:48.039 --> 00:18:49.079
Captain Lu and I discussed it,

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:51.599
and we plan to have her shadow Zhuang Yan

00:18:51.799 --> 00:18:53.319
to handle some basic tasks

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:54.720
and get familiar with the narcotics squad.

00:18:55.759 --> 00:18:56.160
Who is it?

00:18:56.319 --> 00:18:57.119
You know her.

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:06.400
You actually showed up.

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:09.279
Surprised?

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:10.519
Shocked?

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:14.920
Officer Ge Dan,

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:17.359
the narcotics unit is a serious,

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:18.599
very dangerous place.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:20.920
I hope you're not here on a whim.

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:29.000
I know the narcotics unit is a serious,

00:19:29.319 --> 00:19:30.440
very dangerous place.

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:32.880
I'm not doing this on a whim.

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:34.920
To transfer to narcotics,

00:19:35.279 --> 00:19:37.160
I submitted multiple requests to higher-ups.

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:41.960
Narcotics is no place for a woman.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:43.319
Isn't Captain Bai a woman too?

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:46.119
Captain.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:51.960
We just received an anonymous letter.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.160
Someone reported that

00:19:53.519 --> 00:19:56.400
Jiangbei's Zhongtian Logistics is aiding drug trafficking.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.559
No information on the informant yet.

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:00.559
We initially suspect

00:20:00.599 --> 00:20:02.000
it could be an insider.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:05.119
Of course, they're restructuring staff right now,

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:06.799
so it could be a rumor

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:07.799
or a false accusation.

00:20:08.039 --> 00:20:09.559
But since we received a lead,

00:20:09.759 --> 00:20:10.960
we still have to look into it.

00:20:11.359 --> 00:20:12.400
You two head over there.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:14.400
Under the guise of a spot check,

00:20:14.519 --> 00:20:17.359
investigate Zhongtian Logistics.

00:20:17.559 --> 00:20:17.960
Understood.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:20.599
Here's the background info on Zhongtian Logistics.

00:20:22.799 --> 00:20:23.720
Got it. On our way.

00:20:28.839 --> 00:20:29.359
Not bad.

00:20:45.799 --> 00:20:46.400
Who is it?

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:47.079
Coming!

00:20:50.079 --> 00:20:50.680
Auntie Wang.

00:20:50.839 --> 00:20:52.160
Xiaokai!

00:20:52.279 --> 00:20:53.559
You haven't visited in quite a while.

00:20:53.799 --> 00:20:55.000
Here, let me take that.

00:20:55.079 --> 00:20:56.680
Come on in, have a seat.

00:20:56.839 --> 00:20:57.200
All right.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.759
You haven't been around lately.

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:01.359
What've you been busy with?

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:02.680
I've had a lot on my plate recently.

00:21:04.759 --> 00:21:06.599
Xiaokai, no matter how busy you are,

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.720
remember to visit your mother.

00:21:08.799 --> 00:21:10.480
Spare her the worry.

00:21:10.599 --> 00:21:11.519
Okay, got it.

00:21:11.799 --> 00:21:13.359
I'll go see her as soon as I'm free.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:14.440
Good.

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:15.680
Where's Xinjie?

00:21:16.759 --> 00:21:17.440
Oh, Xinjie?

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:20.839
She has the college entrance exam this year.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:24.000
She's always saying study is hectic and stressful.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:26.079
She comes home late at night,

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:28.359
and now locks herself in her room in broad daylight

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:29.519
and won't come out.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.519
You're an older brother to her.

00:21:32.839 --> 00:21:34.359
Do Auntie Wang a favor

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:36.160
and give her a good pep talk.

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:36.799
Sure.

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:38.519
Help her get into a good university.

00:21:38.599 --> 00:21:39.240
I'll go check on her then.

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:40.039
All right.

00:21:40.079 --> 00:21:40.640
I just happened to buy her

00:21:40.759 --> 00:21:41.400
an electronic dictionary.

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:43.960
You're such a good big brother.

00:21:45.119 --> 00:21:45.720
Xinjie.

00:21:58.039 --> 00:21:59.960
There you are, bro.

00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:03.319
You're...

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:07.240
Brother Xiaokai.

00:22:07.799 --> 00:22:08.599
What's wrong, Xinjie?

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:12.440
Nothing's wrong. I'm fine.

00:22:12.559 --> 00:22:13.079
What happened to you?

00:22:13.279 --> 00:22:14.440
I'm fine. Totally fine, okay?

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:17.519
Don't touch me!

00:22:17.599 --> 00:22:19.480
Leave me alone!

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:28.279
This is my...

00:22:33.039 --> 00:22:34.039
Do you know what this is?

00:22:35.359 --> 00:22:36.559
Do you have any idea what this is?

00:22:36.759 --> 00:22:37.640
Give it back!

00:22:37.759 --> 00:22:38.480
Do you have any idea

00:22:38.519 --> 00:22:39.640
how dangerous this stuff is?

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:41.000
Give it back!

00:22:41.079 --> 00:22:42.359
I'm asking you. Where did you get this? Tell me!

00:22:42.599 --> 00:22:43.319
Where did it come from?

00:22:43.359 --> 00:22:43.720
Give it back!

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:44.720
Where did you get it?

00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:45.960
Are you giving it back or not?

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:47.839
Tell me where you got this!

00:22:48.119 --> 00:22:52.160
Help! Someone is stealing my stuff!

00:22:53.079 --> 00:22:54.839
Xiaokai, what are you doing?

00:22:56.440 --> 00:22:57.400
What's going on here?

00:22:59.000 --> 00:22:59.480
What's this?

00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:00.240
Mind your own business!

00:23:00.839 --> 00:23:01.519
Drugs.

00:23:01.519 --> 00:23:02.440
Get out! Get out!

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:05.640
Xinjie...

00:23:05.680 --> 00:23:06.559
Zhao Xinjie, where did you get this stuff?

00:23:06.559 --> 00:23:07.359
I don't need you...

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:10.119
How could you touch this stuff?

00:23:10.279 --> 00:23:11.200
Xinjie, did you hear me?

00:23:11.839 --> 00:23:13.680
Get out! Stay out of my life!

00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:14.519
Calm down!

00:23:14.920 --> 00:23:15.680
Where did you get it?

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:17.240
Tell me!

00:23:18.119 --> 00:23:19.200
Where did it come from?

00:23:19.559 --> 00:23:20.839
I'll tell you!

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:23.480
Back when we were at the club together,

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:26.039
when you were with the boss,

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:28.599
and using way more than I ever did!

00:23:28.759 --> 00:23:30.119
Don't think I didn't know!

00:23:30.319 --> 00:23:31.759
Stop putting on an act!

00:23:31.880 --> 00:23:33.079
You have no right to lecture me!

00:23:33.519 --> 00:23:35.039
You have no right to judge me!

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:36.720
Let go!

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:38.400
You have no right to tell me what to do!

00:23:40.079 --> 00:23:40.960
Zhao Xinjie!

00:23:49.599 --> 00:23:50.720
These are the items

00:23:50.759 --> 00:23:52.440
that Mr. Ma is gifting to Mr. Theerade.

00:23:52.480 --> 00:23:54.920
They're all extremely rare medicines in Southeast Asia.

00:23:56.359 --> 00:23:57.200
Thank you, Mr. Ma.

00:23:58.359 --> 00:24:00.720
Our boss invites Mr. Ma over to his residence.

00:24:01.519 --> 00:24:02.000
Please.

00:24:02.200 --> 00:24:02.799
After you, Mr. Ma.

00:24:52.359 --> 00:24:53.240
Premium green tea

00:25:03.640 --> 00:25:04.839
When did this shipment arrive?

00:25:05.359 --> 00:25:07.200
It arrived this morning.

00:25:07.799 --> 00:25:08.480
It's a rush delivery.

00:25:08.480 --> 00:25:10.039
It needs to reach the customer this afternoon.

00:25:11.160 --> 00:25:13.720
That truck is waiting specifically for this shipment.

00:25:14.319 --> 00:25:15.079
How many boxes in total?

00:25:15.480 --> 00:25:16.920
They're all here. 12 boxes in total.

00:25:16.920 --> 00:25:17.640
12 boxes?

00:25:17.799 --> 00:25:18.279
Yes.

00:25:19.559 --> 00:25:20.119
What's wrong?

00:25:21.000 --> 00:25:22.240
This brand of facial mask

00:25:22.319 --> 00:25:23.720
is sold directly online.

00:25:24.039 --> 00:25:25.319
They have their own official store.

00:25:25.759 --> 00:25:27.079
Normally, it's shipped from Beijing

00:25:27.119 --> 00:25:28.160
directly to the customer.

00:25:28.440 --> 00:25:31.400
You wouldn't see it go from Jiangyang to Nanhai,

00:25:31.759 --> 00:25:33.759
and no one would buy this many boxes at once.

00:25:36.160 --> 00:25:37.519
You think something's off with this?

00:25:39.119 --> 00:25:41.000
Their official website did post an announcement

00:25:41.079 --> 00:25:42.960
that several masks have been out of stock lately,

00:25:43.119 --> 00:25:45.119
including this night-repair formula.

00:25:47.839 --> 00:25:48.960
Open this up and let's check.

00:26:41.440 --> 00:26:42.279
There are so many of them.

00:26:42.799 --> 00:26:43.400
I'm in the warehouse.

00:26:43.480 --> 00:26:44.720
Too many people here. Hurry!

00:26:45.079 --> 00:26:45.640
Where the hell are you guys?

00:26:45.759 --> 00:26:47.119
Don't run around. Listen to me, follow me.

00:26:56.240 --> 00:26:57.160
Where is Zhao Xinjie?

00:26:57.559 --> 00:26:59.039
Who are you? What do you care where she is?

00:27:02.920 --> 00:27:03.680
I'm warning you.

00:27:03.839 --> 00:27:04.920
Xinjie is my sister.

00:27:05.079 --> 00:27:06.200
Stay the hell away from her.

00:27:09.160 --> 00:27:11.039
Come out. I have questions for you.

00:27:11.200 --> 00:27:11.720
Who are you?

00:27:12.079 --> 00:27:13.160
Who are you? Why should I go out with you?

00:27:13.319 --> 00:27:13.680
Get lost!

00:27:16.839 --> 00:27:17.759
Let go of my boss!

00:27:18.279 --> 00:27:18.920
Let go!

00:27:22.400 --> 00:27:23.759
Come with me quietly.

00:27:25.519 --> 00:27:26.680
Don't ask for trouble, any of you.

00:27:39.519 --> 00:27:40.279
What the hell are you doing?

00:27:40.480 --> 00:27:41.319
Don't make me call the cops!

00:27:41.519 --> 00:27:43.240
When the cops get here, I'll tell them

00:27:43.640 --> 00:27:45.400
you're harboring drug dealers here.

00:27:48.839 --> 00:27:49.440
Ow, ow, ow!

00:27:49.599 --> 00:27:50.279
I'm leaving! I'm leaving!

00:27:50.279 --> 00:27:51.400
I'll leave, all right? I'm leaving!

00:27:52.039 --> 00:27:53.039
Take it easy, bro!

00:27:53.440 --> 00:27:53.880
I'm leaving!

00:27:57.279 --> 00:27:59.000
Bro, bro, I never crossed you, did I? Bro!

00:28:02.960 --> 00:28:03.799
Where is Zhao Xinjie?

00:28:04.160 --> 00:28:04.759
Zhao Xinjie?

00:28:05.039 --> 00:28:06.279
Who is Zhao Xinjie to you?

00:28:06.759 --> 00:28:07.839
I'm her brother.

00:28:08.559 --> 00:28:10.160
You're her brother, and you don't know where she is?

00:28:10.160 --> 00:28:10.920
How should I know?

00:28:12.759 --> 00:28:13.039
Bro—

00:28:14.039 --> 00:28:15.559
Who does Zhao Xinjie usually hang out with?

00:28:15.920 --> 00:28:17.039
Where did she get the drugs?

00:28:17.200 --> 00:28:17.759
Drugs?

00:28:18.240 --> 00:28:19.400
I really don't know about drugs, bro!

00:28:21.079 --> 00:28:21.799
I really don't know!

00:28:22.279 --> 00:28:23.160
Bro—

00:28:24.559 --> 00:28:25.759
When her cravings hit,

00:28:25.759 --> 00:28:27.160
where does she go to get drugs?

00:28:27.680 --> 00:28:28.440
I... I don't know!

00:28:28.440 --> 00:28:29.119
I really don't know!

00:28:29.319 --> 00:28:30.240
I really don't know, bro!

00:28:32.519 --> 00:28:33.519
I'll talk! I'll talk! I'll talk!

00:28:33.640 --> 00:28:34.240
I'll talk! I'll talk!

00:28:34.599 --> 00:28:35.799
Let go, let go, let go! I'll talk!

00:29:07.200 --> 00:29:07.559
Please.

00:29:32.279 --> 00:29:32.640
Please,

00:29:35.160 --> 00:29:35.519
Boss,

00:29:36.480 --> 00:29:37.279
wait for me here.

00:30:02.880 --> 00:30:03.279
Sir.

00:30:05.079 --> 00:30:05.839
Mr. Ma has arrived.

00:30:06.279 --> 00:30:06.680
All right.

00:30:08.079 --> 00:30:09.839
Mr. Theerade, an honor to meet you.

00:30:11.440 --> 00:30:13.200
Welcome, welcome. Please have a seat.

00:30:13.640 --> 00:30:14.160
After you.

00:30:18.519 --> 00:30:19.680
Mr. Qin mentioned

00:30:19.839 --> 00:30:21.440
that your visit to Country M

00:30:21.799 --> 00:30:24.279
was mainly to experience the local culture.

00:30:25.119 --> 00:30:27.079
I wonder how I might be of assistance?

00:30:28.279 --> 00:30:29.480
My wife and I

00:30:29.680 --> 00:30:32.079
really love the culture of Country M,

00:30:32.240 --> 00:30:33.359
so we're planning

00:30:33.359 --> 00:30:35.079
to purchase a property here

00:30:35.799 --> 00:30:37.559
to settle down in the future.

00:30:38.680 --> 00:30:39.599
Since you have such intentions,

00:30:40.039 --> 00:30:41.240
I'll have my men

00:30:41.240 --> 00:30:42.880
scout out a prime location for you.

00:30:43.319 --> 00:30:45.240
Don't you Chinese value feng shui?

00:30:45.559 --> 00:30:46.720
I know a thing or two about it myself.

00:30:47.319 --> 00:30:48.839
I'm sure I can help Mr. Ma find

00:30:48.880 --> 00:30:49.799
a place to your liking.

00:30:50.559 --> 00:30:51.559
Thank you, Mr. Theerade.

00:30:52.559 --> 00:30:55.079
Because I frequently move cargo

00:30:55.279 --> 00:30:56.240
back and forth between both regions,

00:30:56.839 --> 00:30:57.720
my visit to Country M this time

00:30:57.720 --> 00:31:00.440
is in hopes of getting to know

00:31:00.480 --> 00:31:02.079
some business partners.

00:31:02.920 --> 00:31:03.960
Given your high prestige and standing

00:31:03.960 --> 00:31:07.160
in Country M's business community,

00:31:07.799 --> 00:31:10.039
I wondered if you might lend a hand.

00:31:11.039 --> 00:31:13.400
"Know the land to win; choose the land to profit."

00:31:13.759 --> 00:31:15.119
That Mr. Ma grasps such principles,

00:31:15.119 --> 00:31:16.079
I quite admire.

00:31:17.680 --> 00:31:20.039
However, I mainly deal in tourism in Country M,

00:31:20.119 --> 00:31:21.880
while Mr. Ma is in trade.

00:31:22.559 --> 00:31:24.519
I'm afraid I may not be of much help.

00:31:29.240 --> 00:31:31.559
As they say, character precedes business.

00:31:32.279 --> 00:31:34.240
Mr. Ma is new in town,

00:31:34.720 --> 00:31:36.079
and this is only our first meeting.

00:31:36.079 --> 00:31:38.079
Talking business now is likely premature.

00:31:38.480 --> 00:31:39.599
Still, since you've come, Mr. Ma,

00:31:39.599 --> 00:31:40.720
you are my guest.

00:31:42.119 --> 00:31:44.079
Arrange a hotel for Mr. Ma,

00:31:44.400 --> 00:31:47.119
and show him around over the next few days.

00:31:47.680 --> 00:31:48.039
Yes, sir.

00:31:49.880 --> 00:31:50.759
Mr. Theerade—

00:31:50.920 --> 00:31:51.559
Look, Mr. Ma.

00:31:52.519 --> 00:31:54.880
Since Mr. Theerade has already made arrangements,

00:31:55.240 --> 00:31:56.720
let's follow our host's lead.

00:31:59.440 --> 00:32:01.640
Then we won't trouble Mr. Theerade any further.

00:32:03.920 --> 00:32:04.400
Thank you.

00:32:05.519 --> 00:32:05.839
Goodbye.

00:32:26.039 --> 00:32:27.200
They were all produced last month.

00:32:28.079 --> 00:32:28.720
Old stock?

00:32:31.079 --> 00:32:32.720
If this Gao Min runs a beauty salon,

00:32:32.880 --> 00:32:34.559
then it all makes sense.

00:32:38.480 --> 00:32:39.400
380 grams.

00:32:44.400 --> 00:32:45.720
There's definitely more than 380 grams here.

00:33:00.319 --> 00:33:00.839
Heroin.

00:33:02.599 --> 00:33:04.680
None of today's shipments are going out.

00:33:05.079 --> 00:33:06.720
All personnel must wait to be inspected.

00:33:07.400 --> 00:33:08.119
Understood. Right away.

00:33:16.240 --> 00:33:19.759
What is Mr. Theerade really up to?

00:33:21.880 --> 00:33:23.720
Theerade is a very shrewd man.

00:33:24.480 --> 00:33:26.000
I've dealt with him for over three years,

00:33:26.000 --> 00:33:27.480
and he still doesn't fully trust me.

00:33:28.319 --> 00:33:30.240
Let alone a newcomer like you.

00:33:30.920 --> 00:33:32.720
Still, you're smart, Mr. Ma.

00:33:33.279 --> 00:33:34.720
You brought what he needed.

00:33:35.440 --> 00:33:37.720
It's clear he likes you.

00:33:39.880 --> 00:33:40.200
By the way,

00:33:40.559 --> 00:33:42.720
how did you know that near Jiechan State,

00:33:43.000 --> 00:33:44.319
a new strain of malaria would break out?

00:33:45.799 --> 00:33:47.480
To meet with Mr. Theerade,

00:33:48.079 --> 00:33:50.000
one must come prepared.

00:33:50.640 --> 00:33:51.640
Know who you're dealing with.

00:33:53.720 --> 00:33:54.279
Mr. Qin,

00:33:55.039 --> 00:33:56.480
this Mr. Theerade—

00:33:56.640 --> 00:33:57.839
how does he speak such fluent Chinese?

00:33:59.480 --> 00:34:01.319
He's had quite a legendary life.

00:34:02.000 --> 00:34:03.480
Theerade is originally of Chinese descent.

00:34:03.759 --> 00:34:04.799
Decades ago,

00:34:05.000 --> 00:34:07.119
his mother remarried and moved here.

00:34:07.359 --> 00:34:08.800
So he came along with her.

00:34:09.400 --> 00:34:10.559
A few years ago, his stepfather

00:34:10.760 --> 00:34:12.639
tragically died in a car accident.

00:34:13.239 --> 00:34:15.159
So he took over the family business.

00:34:15.400 --> 00:34:16.519
A few years later,

00:34:16.519 --> 00:34:18.880
he became a prominent businessman in Country M.

00:34:22.199 --> 00:34:24.159
Then how does Mr. Theerade

00:34:25.159 --> 00:34:28.519
stand with Country M's Four Great Families?

00:34:28.719 --> 00:34:29.440
How should I put it?

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:32.719
On the surface, things seem calm.

00:34:33.519 --> 00:34:34.760
In our line of work,

00:34:35.199 --> 00:34:36.159
can anyone really avoid conflict?

00:34:36.840 --> 00:34:38.000
Still,

00:34:38.480 --> 00:34:39.599
this man

00:34:39.840 --> 00:34:41.719
has solid ties with the business community

00:34:41.719 --> 00:34:43.440
and police in Country M.

00:34:43.840 --> 00:34:46.400
So if you want to move goods from Country M to the mainland,

00:34:46.679 --> 00:34:47.599
partnering with him

00:34:48.599 --> 00:34:49.599
is still your safest bet.

00:35:31.840 --> 00:35:33.400
It's so late.

00:35:34.079 --> 00:35:36.079
Who'd be looking for you?

00:35:36.960 --> 00:35:37.679
Let me check.

00:35:53.800 --> 00:35:54.480
Who is it?

00:35:54.840 --> 00:35:56.480
Hello, gas company.

00:35:56.920 --> 00:35:58.559
A neighbor reported a gas leak in your unit.

00:36:14.440 --> 00:36:16.440
Police! Run!

00:36:23.400 --> 00:36:24.079
Hello?

00:36:24.639 --> 00:36:26.239
A gas leak is a serious matter.

00:36:26.719 --> 00:36:27.800
Please hurry up.

00:36:35.000 --> 00:36:36.480
Hold on, I'm getting dressed.

00:36:37.760 --> 00:36:38.079
Over here.

00:36:48.320 --> 00:36:49.599
Don't move! Don't move!

00:36:50.800 --> 00:36:51.239
Get out!

00:36:52.800 --> 00:36:53.360
Cuff him!

00:37:04.079 --> 00:37:05.079
The suspect jumped and fled!

00:37:05.280 --> 00:37:06.599
Team B, pursue immediately!

00:37:16.320 --> 00:37:17.199
Did you get the license plate?

00:37:17.719 --> 00:37:19.360
Black Honda, ending in 479.

00:37:20.159 --> 00:37:20.760
Team B! Team B!

00:37:21.280 --> 00:37:22.800
Suspect vehicle is a black Honda,

00:37:23.000 --> 00:37:23.840
plate ending in 479.

00:37:24.400 --> 00:37:25.519
Contact traffic control right away.

00:37:31.519 --> 00:37:32.639
Inside this shipment of facial masks,

00:37:32.639 --> 00:37:34.679
a total of 1.5 kilograms of heroin was seized.

00:37:35.480 --> 00:37:36.440
The consignee is Gao Min,

00:37:36.800 --> 00:37:38.119
who runs a beauty salon.

00:37:38.760 --> 00:37:40.119
According to logistics records,

00:37:40.760 --> 00:37:41.760
over the past three months,

00:37:42.159 --> 00:37:44.039
Gao Min received three shipments of the same brand.

00:37:44.440 --> 00:37:47.039
And all of them were sent from Jiangyang.

00:37:48.159 --> 00:37:49.960
The sender is Xinghai Trading,

00:37:50.760 --> 00:37:51.639
a small-scale company.

00:37:51.880 --> 00:37:53.199
The legal representative is Cheng Weimin.

00:37:55.960 --> 00:37:57.519
We've contacted the Jiangyang police.

00:37:57.800 --> 00:37:59.000
Regarding Xinghai Trading,

00:37:59.000 --> 00:38:00.039
they've launched an urgent investigation.

00:38:00.119 --> 00:38:00.880
Ever since this afternoon,

00:38:01.159 --> 00:38:02.639
when the masks were intercepted,

00:38:02.880 --> 00:38:04.239
Cheng Weimin has gone missing.

00:38:04.840 --> 00:38:05.960
We now suspect

00:38:06.400 --> 00:38:07.519
that inside this logistics company,

00:38:07.760 --> 00:38:09.039
there's an informant for the drug cartel.

00:38:11.079 --> 00:38:12.199
As for Cheng Weimin,

00:38:12.480 --> 00:38:13.320
we haven't found

00:38:13.320 --> 00:38:14.679
any criminal record on him yet.

00:38:15.519 --> 00:38:17.280
The suspect Gao Min is in custody,

00:38:17.519 --> 00:38:18.199
awaiting interrogation.

00:38:21.639 --> 00:38:22.599
What about the other suspect?

00:38:23.519 --> 00:38:24.199
Any news?

00:38:24.599 --> 00:38:25.960
During the previous interrogation,

00:38:26.320 --> 00:38:28.000
Gao Min refused to talk.

00:38:29.000 --> 00:38:30.440
As for the suspects on the run,

00:38:30.639 --> 00:38:31.400
we don't have

00:38:31.400 --> 00:38:32.599
any other useful leads.

00:38:36.239 --> 00:38:36.519
Captain,

00:38:37.920 --> 00:38:40.199
it was my oversight during the operation

00:38:40.960 --> 00:38:42.199
that let the suspect get away.

00:38:43.480 --> 00:38:44.519
I take full responsibility.

00:38:51.199 --> 00:38:53.880
What oversight are you talking about?

00:38:54.920 --> 00:38:56.119
I tried to be clever

00:38:56.960 --> 00:38:58.119
and used a gas leak excuse

00:38:59.000 --> 00:39:00.159
to get the suspect to open the door.

00:39:00.440 --> 00:39:02.119
Turned out it was a commercial property,

00:39:02.639 --> 00:39:03.480
a serviced apartment.

00:39:04.159 --> 00:39:05.079
There's no gas line.

00:39:12.320 --> 00:39:13.519
Being able to spot your mistake

00:39:14.360 --> 00:39:15.320
and admit it

00:39:15.719 --> 00:39:16.840
shows you're improving.

00:39:17.320 --> 00:39:18.480
As your superior,

00:39:19.000 --> 00:39:19.880
I give you credit for that.

00:39:22.400 --> 00:39:23.440
Let's interrogate Gao Min.

00:39:23.880 --> 00:39:24.679
Press her through the night

00:39:24.880 --> 00:39:27.280
to see if we can get any valuable leads.

00:39:27.719 --> 00:39:28.159
Yes, sir.

00:39:36.960 --> 00:39:38.599
Bro, I already told you.

00:39:38.599 --> 00:39:40.199
To find Xinjie, you have to find Xu Na first.

00:39:40.440 --> 00:39:42.199
They're besties and hang out all the time.

00:39:43.079 --> 00:39:44.320
And the one who got Xinjie hooked on heroin

00:39:44.320 --> 00:39:45.239
was that woman!

00:39:45.639 --> 00:39:46.960
I warned Xinjie a long time ago

00:39:47.119 --> 00:39:48.599
not to hang out with someone like her.

00:39:49.440 --> 00:39:50.920
Friends like that are nothing but trouble!

00:39:54.400 --> 00:39:56.360
Ac-Actually, I tried to stop Xinjie,

00:39:56.480 --> 00:39:57.519
but do you know what she said?

00:39:57.800 --> 00:39:59.760
She told everyone to mind their own business.

00:40:00.039 --> 00:40:00.760
By the way, Bro,

00:40:01.559 --> 00:40:03.159
when you go to the club to look for Xu Na,

00:40:03.280 --> 00:40:05.239
whatever you do, don't say I brought you.

00:40:05.639 --> 00:40:06.519
That woman,

00:40:06.679 --> 00:40:08.239
she has a guy at the club named

00:40:08.760 --> 00:40:10.199
Brother Biao backing her up.

00:40:10.760 --> 00:40:12.280
Brother Biao has so many lackeys under him.

00:40:13.000 --> 00:40:14.280
Going there alone to demand someone...

00:40:14.800 --> 00:40:15.920
You've got to be careful!

00:40:35.559 --> 00:40:35.800
Get out of the car.

00:40:36.159 --> 00:40:37.440
Bro, aren't you going in alone?

00:40:38.199 --> 00:40:39.000
No, no, no! Bro, bro!

00:40:39.000 --> 00:40:39.920
Don't drag me with you, bro!

00:40:40.440 --> 00:40:41.800
This place isn't for me, bro! Don't!

00:40:57.920 --> 00:41:00.440
I call the shots here.

00:41:03.880 --> 00:41:05.119
Brother Wei, Brother Wei.

00:41:05.920 --> 00:41:06.920
Is Sister Na around?

00:41:07.159 --> 00:41:07.800
Someone's looking for her.

00:41:08.280 --> 00:41:08.840
Who?

00:41:09.400 --> 00:41:10.360
That guy over there.

00:41:10.480 --> 00:41:11.599
Says Zhao Xinjie is his sister.

00:41:11.679 --> 00:41:12.800
And she's close with Sister Na.

00:41:13.000 --> 00:41:14.360
So I brought him over.

00:41:14.559 --> 00:41:15.800
Cut the sister crap.

00:41:16.039 --> 00:41:16.440
Beat it!

00:41:20.000 --> 00:41:21.519
Bro, Xu Na isn't here. Let's go.

00:41:25.719 --> 00:41:26.360
Where is Xu Na?

00:41:29.199 --> 00:41:30.079
Who the hell are you?

00:41:32.119 --> 00:41:33.519
I asked you, where is Xu Na?

00:41:34.480 --> 00:41:34.800
Scram!

00:41:36.239 --> 00:41:36.719
Get lost!

00:41:37.320 --> 00:41:37.679
I...

00:41:39.559 --> 00:41:40.559
Brother Wei, Brother Wei!

00:42:02.760 --> 00:42:04.199
Come on!

00:42:04.400 --> 00:42:04.920
Cheers!

00:42:04.920 --> 00:42:06.239
Come on, drink up!

00:42:06.280 --> 00:42:06.480
Let's get wild!

00:42:09.960 --> 00:42:10.480
Turn it up!

00:42:10.480 --> 00:42:11.000
Brother Biao.

00:42:11.320 --> 00:42:12.840
Someone outside is looking for Sister Na.

00:42:12.840 --> 00:42:13.920
He's fighting our guys.

00:42:14.360 --> 00:42:15.559
It's just one guy, what are you scared of?

00:42:15.559 --> 00:42:16.239
Tell him to get lost.

00:42:16.400 --> 00:42:18.000
But Brother Wei and the guys can't take him!

00:42:21.880 --> 00:42:22.559
Someone's looking for you.

00:42:23.719 --> 00:42:24.280
I'll go check.

00:42:25.119 --> 00:42:25.920
Okay, go ahead.

00:42:28.800 --> 00:42:29.800
Come on, let's keep going.

00:42:34.800 --> 00:42:35.639
Stop!

00:42:44.159 --> 00:42:44.840
Brother Biao!

00:42:46.320 --> 00:42:47.360
He's here to trash the place!

00:42:47.360 --> 00:42:48.679
Shut up!

00:42:52.760 --> 00:42:53.440
Who are you?

00:42:53.880 --> 00:42:54.719
I'm looking for Xu Na.

00:42:55.360 --> 00:42:56.239
To ask where my sister is.

00:42:56.599 --> 00:42:57.199
Looking for who?

00:42:57.960 --> 00:42:58.719
Looking for Xu Na.

00:43:01.320 --> 00:43:02.039
Looking for Xu Na?

00:43:02.880 --> 00:43:04.079
Xu Na is my girl.

00:43:05.320 --> 00:43:05.719
Come on.

00:43:08.519 --> 00:43:09.199
Come on.